36637>>>>>>>    //
36637>>>>>>>    //  Sets the time of the datetime variable to the time in the string.
36637>>>>>>>    //
36637>>>>>>>    //  Params:
36637>>>>>>>    //      dtTime  Datetime variable to add time to
